Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:02.12,ReelSub,,0,0,0,,DUE TO POOR COMMUNICATION SKILLS,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.12,0:00:04.54,ReelSub,,0,0,0,,HOW DIFFICULT LIFE BECOMES,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.54,0:00:07.42,ReelSub,,0,0,0,,I WILL SHARE A CASE.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.42,0:00:10.98,ReelSub,,0,0,0,,I AM DR. HYMA PRASAD,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.98,0:00:13.56,ReelSub,,0,0,0,,PSYCHOLOGIST.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.56,0:00:17.58,ReelSub,,0,0,0,,AMONG THE CASES I HANDLED,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.58,0:00:20.94,ReelSub,,0,0,0,,ONE BOY HAD COMMUNICATION...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.94,0:00:22.80,ReelSub,,0,0,0,,HE STUDIES VERY WELL,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.80,0:00:24.84,ReelSub,,0,0,0,,GETS GOOD MARKS,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.84,0:00:26.60,ReelSub,,0,0,0,,EVERYTHING IS GREAT.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.60,0:00:28.56,ReelSub,,0,0,0,,HIS ENTIRE RECORD IS EXCELLENT.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.56,0:00:30.56,ReelSub,,0,0,0,,VERY GOOD, EXCELLENT.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.56,0:00:32.54,ReelSub,,0,0,0,,BUT WHEN SPEAKING,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.54,0:00:34.88,ReelSub,,0,0,0,,HE FEARS ENGLISH.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.88,0:00:37.16,ReelSub,,0,0,0,,AFRAID TO TALK TO PEOPLE.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.16,0:00:40.54,ReelSub,,0,0,0,,AFRAID TO ATTEND COACHING CLASSES.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.54,0:00:43.18,ReelSub,,0,0,0,,WITH SO MANY FEARS,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.18,0:00:45.42,ReelSub,,0,0,0,,HE COULDN'T FACE INTERVIEWS.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.42,0:00:46.72,ReelSub,,0,0,0,,ATTENDING INTERVIEWS,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.72,0:00:48.06,ReelSub,,0,0,0,,AND GETTING REJECTED.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.06,0:00:49.96,ReelSub,,0,0,0,,WHY IS THIS HAPPENING?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.96,0:00:52.82,ReelSub,,0,0,0,,MAINLY, THESE DAYS,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.82,0:00:55.44,ReelSub,,0,0,0,,NO NEED TO FEAR ENGLISH.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.44,0:00:58.74,ReelSub,,0,0,0,,EVERY SUBJECT IS IN ENGLISH.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.74,0:01:00.90,ReelSub,,0,0,0,,EVEN SO, WHY IS HE AFRAID?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.90,0:01:03.88,ReelSub,,0,0,0,,BECAUSE...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.88,0:01:06.82,ReelSub,,0,0,0,,HE VIEWS INTERVIEWS THROUGH A LENS.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.82,0:01:10.36,ReelSub,,0,0,0,,MAGNIFYING THEM WITH FEAR.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.36,0:01:13.10,ReelSub,,0,0,0,,YOU HAVE THE SUBJECT THEORETICALLY,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.10,0:01:16.54,ReelSub,,0,0,0,,BUT LACK THE WAY TO EXPLAIN IT.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.54,0:01:18.48,ReelSub,,0,0,0,,YOU KNOW THE SUBJECT,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.48,0:01:20.52,ReelSub,,0,0,0,,YOU CAN EXPLAIN IT,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.52,0:01:22.74,ReelSub,,0,0,0,,BUT CANNOT EXPRESS IT.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.74,0:01:25.34,ReelSub,,0,0,0,,UNABLE TO EXPRESS HIMSELF,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.34,0:01:27.72,ReelSub,,0,0,0,,DESPITE KNOWING ALL ANSWERS,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.72,0:01:30.00,ReelSub,,0,0,0,,HE FAILED MANY INTERVIEWS.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.00,0:01:32.58,ReelSub,,0,0,0,,I'LL TELL YOU HOW TO PRACTICE.
